          "question": "300 मीटर लंबी एक ट्रेन 90 किमी/घंटा की गति से चल रही है। 200 मीटर लंबे पुल को पार करने में इसे कितने सेकंड लगेंगे?",
          "options": {
            "A": "20",
            "B": "15",
            "C": "25",
            "D": "30"
          },
          "explanation": "गति = 25 मीटर/सेकंड। कुल दूरी = 500. समय = 500 / 25 = 20."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aptitude-09-012",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "Two numbers are in the ratio 5:6. If 8 is subtracted from each, the ratio becomes 4:5. Find the numbers.",
      "options": {
        "A": "40, 48",
        "B": "30, 36",
        "C": "50, 60",
        "D": "25, 30"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "(5x-8)/(6x-8) = 4/5 => 25x-40 = 24x-32 => x = 8. Numbers are 40, 48.",
      "hash": "adf873ee75d7d238",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो संख्याएँ 5:6 के अनुपात में हैं। यदि प्रत्येक में से 8 घटाया जाता है, तो अनुपात 4:5 हो जाता है। संख्याएँ ज्ञात कीजिए।",
          "options": {
            "A": "40, 48",
            "B": "30, 36",
            "C": "50, 60",
            "D": "25, 30"
          },
          "explanation": "(5x-8)/(6x-8) = 4/5 => x = 8. संख्याएँ 40, 48 हैं।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aptitude-09-013",
      "number": 13,
      "question": "The average of 50 numbers is 38. If two numbers, namely 45 and 55, are discarded, the average of the remaining numbers is?",
      "options": {
        "A": "37.5",
        "B": "37",
        "C": "38",
        "D": "36.5"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Total sum = 50 * 38 = 1900. New sum = 1900 - 100 = 1800. New average = 1800 / 48 = 37.5.",
      "hash": "364af6ae4a9601cf",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "50 संख्याओं का औसत 38 है। यदि दो संख्याएँ, अर्थात् 45 और 55, निकाल दी जाती हैं, तो शेष संख्याओं का औसत क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "37.5",
            "B": "37",
            "C": "38",
            "D": "36.5"
          },
          "explanation": "कुल योग = 1900. नया योग = 1800. नया औसत = 1800 / 48 = 37.5."
        }
      }
    },
