      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "L+B = 23, L^2+B^2 = 289. (L+B)^2 = L^2+B^2+2LB => 529 = 289 + 2LB => 2LB = 240 => LB = 120.",
      "hash": "3ebd80f10dcb11b5",
